  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> for which twice the sum of the cubes of the roots of the equation <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> attains its minimum value is (where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "greater than <math><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "less than <math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "greater than <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "less than <math><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Let <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math> be the roots. Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>E</mi></math> (say)<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0079_7f6aa3090b21.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.37986in;height:1.11319in\" /><br />Thus, <math><mi>E</mi></math> attains its minimum value at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>"
  }
